# #158 -- the real, current full range as of this session.
#
# All 5 real Series with Frankly members now correctly grouped at the
# very top: tgs:Series.HowToThinkAboutTheFuture, tgs:Series.JustStopOil,
# tgs:Series.AGuideToStayingHuman, tgs:Series.OilTrilogy, and
