# per MJSullivan's own direct standing reminder that Series individuals
# belong at the top). Two real,
# significant merge-time fixes: (1) HowToThinkAboutTheFuture and
# JustStopOil were originally positioned at the top of their OWN
# batch file, but a numeric-order merge scatters that positioning --
# both extracted and moved back to this file's own true top. (2)
# AGuideToStayingHuman and OilTrilogy were discovered completely
# MISSING from every batch file -- both built early this session,
# before any batch-pilot work began, living only in the original
# episodes.ttl and never captured by any batch's own extraction
# regex. Both added here directly from the original source, verified
# against entity counts before and after (25/25/25/25/25/25/8 = 158,
# matching exactly).
#
# All batch files should be moved to archive/ once this merge is
# confirmed correct.
#############################################

