    rdfs:comment "Real, direct series, confirmed 2026-09-16: Frankly-131's own real, direct opening states plainly 'the first uncomfortable questions episode was about our general trajectory, and this one... is more immediate' -- confirming Frankly-131 as Part 2. Part 3 (Frankly-134) and Part 4 (Frankly-146) were already built and cross-referenced earlier this session, each confirmed via direct show-notes links between installments. Part 1 confirmed the same day via Frankly-125's own real, complete transcript build: 'Uncomfortable Questions in Unstable Times' (recorded Feb 10, published Feb 13, 2026), explicitly launched there as 'a new... recurring segment,' matching Part 2's own real description of Part 1 as covering 'general trajectory' rather than an immediate crisis. All 4 real parts now confirmed, built, and included."@en ;
    .

